edSpellContainer</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Wildshape_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wildshape (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">Wildshape</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variants\"> Variants </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Warm\" title=\"Fire Shield: Warm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp/60px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp/80px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Shield: Warm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Fire_Shield_Warm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Warm\" title=\"Fire Shield: Warm\">Fire Shield: Warm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Chill\" title=\"Fire Shield: Chill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp/60px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp/80px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Shield: Chill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Fire_Shield_Chill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Chill\" title=\"Fire Shield: Chill\">Fire Shield: Chill</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 7: <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/The_Fiend\" title=\"The Fiend\">The Fiend</a></li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal\" title=\"Emblazoned Plate of the Marshal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Emblazoned_Plate_of_the_Marshal\" title=\"Emblazoned Plate of the Marshal\">Emblazoned Plate of the Marshal</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield\" title=\"Scroll of Fire Shield\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Fire_Shield\" title=\"Scroll of Fire Shield\">Scroll of Fire Shield</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Characters cannot have both variants of this spell active at the same time.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Contrary to the description, neither <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Warm_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Shield: Warm (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Shield: Warm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Fire_Shield_Warm_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Warm_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Shield: Warm (Condition)\">Fire Shield: Warm</a> nor <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Chill_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Shield: Chill (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire Shield: Chill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Fire_Shield_Chill_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Shield:_Chill_(Condition)\" title=\"Fire Shield: Chill (Condition)\">Fire Shield: Chill</a> applies any gameplay light effect to the affected creature.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/f/f1/Fire_Shield_Visuals.m